Lab #16 – Blind SQL Injection with Out-of-Band Data Exfiltration

Vulnerable Parameter:

Tracking cookie

Goal:

Extract the administrator password.
Log in as the administrator user.

Analysis:

The application did not display query results or error messages.
An out-of-band SQL injection payload was injected into the TrackingId cookie.
The payload sent the administrator's password to a Burp Collaborator domain through a DNS lookup.
Burp Collaborator received a request containing the password value.
The extracted password was 0fpkzao19uq428v3bbde.
The password was then used to log in as the administrator user.

Result:

Successfully extracted the administrator password.
Successfully logged in as the administrator account.
